><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:ubersetzend"><abbr>übsnd.</abbr></ref></hi> <hi rend="bold">2</hi>) <hi rend="italic">gerichtlich untersuchend erweisen:</hi> þeofas fule (<hi rend="italic">als schuldig</hi>) 9; þæt (<hi rend="italic">es</hi>), þæt (<hi rend="italic">dass</hi>) hit soð is <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVEg">IV Eg</ref> 10; þone (<hi rend="italic">welchen</hi>) on folcriht ~, þæt <ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAs">VI As</ref> 1,1; de quo vere fuerit inquisitum <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Quadr">Q</ref>; <hi rend="italic">was wohl vorlag <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:fur"><abbr>für</abbr></ref></hi> per verum reveletur in eo IV 6</dictScrap>
